{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02564","headline":"七夕赋咏成篇 · 许敬宗","name":"七夕赋咏成篇","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"一年抱怨嗟长别，七夕含态始言归。\n飘飘罗袜光天步，灼灼新妆鉴月辉。\n情催巧笑开星靥，不惜呈露解云衣。\n所叹却随更漏尽，掩泣还弄昨宵机。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"许敬宗","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_02564.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02564","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}